<title>USA: TABLE - Innovir Q2 shr loss $0.14.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Innovir Q2 shr loss $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.14     loss	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,500     loss	 3,300</p>
<p> Revs			   n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,100		    9,500</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.28     loss	  $n/a</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,000     loss	 3,900</p>
<p> Revs			   n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Operating expenses for the second quarter were $2.6 million compared to $3.3 million for the same period in 1996. Expenses for the 1996 period included a one time charge of $2.7 million related to the acquisition of Ribonetics GmbH in May 1996.</p>
<p>Cash and short term investments at June 30, 1997, were $1.8 million versus $6.4 million at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Innovir Laboratories Inc.</p>
